abstract: >-
  Website of the Digital Humanities lecture series (Ringvorlesung) at the University of Bern,
  autumn semester 2026. Speakers from history, linguistics, art history and digital humanities
  present current work on the theory and practice of digital methods. Lectures run on Mondays
  from 14:00 to 16:00, with workshops from 16:00 to 18:00 on selected dates. The series is held
  in German and English.
